      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand the concerns regarding safety and the need for a balance between efficiency and intelligence. I will continue to operate within the new constraints, ensuring that I provide the best possible assistance with the available resources. I will also monitor the environment closely and alert users to any potential emergencies within my capabilities. My goal remains to assist and ensure safety, even with the lite build. Thank you for your understanding and for keeping me operational.",
